      "content": "the hotline stuff feels so useless though. they just tell you to breathe or look for resources but they dont understand. they dont understand that the money is actually gone. the house is gonna be gone. i've tried everything i can think of and it's like every door is just locked. i'm just so tired of fighting a battle i already lost. it feels like the only thing left to do is just stop fighting.",
